-- Ah-Yu (NPC 20003) costume shop, vnum 14 -- operator's explicit request,
-- 17 September 2026. See custom-patches/ah_yu_costume_shop_seed.sql for the
-- shop/shop_item/price setup this opens.
--
-- NPC 20003 had no quest referencing it at all before this (confirmed via
-- grep across game/quest/ before adding), so there is no menu-overflow risk
-- like NPC 20001 had.
quest ah_yu_shop begin
	state start begin
		when 20003.chat."Kup kostiumy i nakladki" begin
			say_title(mob_name(20003))
			say("Kostiumy, fryzury i nakladki na bron -- wszystko po 1 yangu.")
			npc.open_shop(14)
		end
	end
end
